{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Summer's Gone is a high-quality, Interactive Visual Novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is about healing, hope, and love.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A young man plagued by depression and isolation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/288065fc698efe8d5a3d8717246479de.avif?t=1756646792\" width=572 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game explores numerous essential topics, including mental health, ambition &amp; love.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Depression, shame, loneliness, and not fitting into a social template are some of the primary topics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/831a38fc207b35a43b7bfbe6e572cc53.avif?t=1756646792\" width=572 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Much emphasis is placed on worldbuilding, interpersonal connection, and, especially, the characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dating, love, and overcoming obstacles together are the premises of Summer's Gone.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/f37bd8c5ca4054a05dcffafd6c9266b5.avif?t=1756646792\" width=572 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SG Season 1 features a wide variety of characters who accompany the main character through a new Chapter of his life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The MC has isolated himself for a long time, but is now faced with something that falls outside his comfort zone, challenging him like nothing has before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/4fcc2a3f7bde58916fd7afbd6917edc3.avif?t=1756646792\" width=572 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">**College &amp; Sports**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once upon a time, he was the star player on the high school basketball team, and now the college tryouts are just a few weeks away.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But there's something in the back of your mind... Why couldn't you choose a college? Why did you have to go to the ZPR college?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mysteries are about to unfold, and comfort zones are to be shattered.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Summer's Gone - Season 1 is interactive! Your choices matter!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/d446384f73ebe2cd51848a5d56890c99.avif?t=1756646792\" width=574 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">*&quot;Homesickness for a place I've never been.&quot;* </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240150/extras/4b295de56d5435b489bdca44ea7358d1.avif?t=1756646792\" width=572 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"E for Equality.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/22c6718b3e0d0211a5dfddea299420283914cee9.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/a1aca6bba78bc726bfff955aa5487e54aefe9b82.jpg"},{"name":"A favor from Maja.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/f74b9624c028e534fa5342975c0043a2665310a2.jpg"},{"name":"MC Wiggly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/5baa8f6462a3636b3dbed5a70705d4944f8f5187.jpg"},{"name":"Gym Bros.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/b03fdd26a1ff51412a7ba7f09c6b8b9ce9fc25ea.jpg"},{"name":"The prefect.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/e8599661ecaa153c4e7f5e9b52b8374627570c69.jpg"},{"name":"Date with Victoria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/a41f19928986a79da7f1893e77ebe49715e3d207.jpg"},{"name":"Nightly Adventures with Bella","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/0e6bfa599188d1a708d8dfec30e979bba301b703.jpg"},{"name":"Homesickness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/2d64aab1e467cba094a5e63f16e266c1ece06fe2.jpg"},{"name":"The promise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240150/958bb469f69f209373f5af8308955b8b7c24d388.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2240150?t=1756646792","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2240150?t=1756646792","capsule_image":"https: